{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolistitemdata"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Navigations"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemData"},{"type":"text","text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a mandatory label (an "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextualContent"},{"type":"text","text":" or a custom "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":") and optional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"description, overline, extra label and helper text. Every textual field accepts a raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a localized string or an ","type":"text"},{"code":"AttributedString","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" through "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOTextualContent"},{"type":"text","text":", plus optional slots."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples"},{"code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (string literal is implicitly converted to .textual(.raw))","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\"))","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: .textual(\"Label\", isBold: true))","","    \/\/ Localized label","    let data = MISOListItemData(label: .textual(.localized(\"label.key\")))","","    \/\/ Styled rich label (user-controlled font, color, markdown…)","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: .textual(.rich(AttributedString.from(text: \"Label\",","                                                        foregroundColor: .orange,","                                                        font: .headline)))","    )","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with text label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        hasBoldLabel: false,","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with custom view label","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Overline as a user-styled rich text (AttributedString)","    \/\/ Same \"overline\" parameter name as the String variant, disambiguated by the value's type.","    let data = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        description: .rich(myStyledDescription),","        overline: \"Plain overline\",","        helperText: .rich(myStyledHelper)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    MISOStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    MISONavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: MISOListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Custom view label","anchor":"Custom-view-label"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When providing a custom view as label:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bold styling is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You must provide an ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Small size behavior","anchor":"Small-size-behavior"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".misoListItemSize(.small)"},{"text":" modifier),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the ","type":"text"},{"code":"overline","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"extraLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" properties are ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"automatically hidden","type":"text"}]},{"text":" to ensure a compact layout.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Only the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"label"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"description"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"type":"text","text":" remain visible."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"bottomSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", but the "},{"code":"textSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" remains displayed."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    MISOStaticListItem(data: MISOListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .misoListItemSize(.small)"]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"MISOListItemData","roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemData","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:14MISOComponents16MISOListItemDataV","role":"symbol","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"na